second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"What is the population of Qorveh?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0043-356e2b3616e8:d00\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 205, \"text\": \"Qerveh, Zanjan Qerveh (, also Romanized as Qorveh; also known as Farvah, Ghorveh, Quenveh, and Qurveh) is a village in Howmeh Rural District, in the Central District of Abhar County, Zanjan Province, Iran.\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0043-356e2b3616e8:d00\", \"start\": 206, \"end\": 268, \"text\": \"At the 2006 census, its population was 2,772, in 720 families.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0043-356e2b3616e8:d00\", \"start\": 269, \"end\": 322, \"text\": \"Qerveh is one of the oldest villages in Abhar County.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0043-356e2b3616e8:d00\", \"start\": 323, \"end\": 583, \"text\": \"This area has more than three thousand years of history, leaving some remains: the old house built on cliff, the Imam Zadeh abol kheirebne mosabne jafar (امامزاده ابوالخیر بن موسی بن جعفر) and the old Sadat cemetery which has two young martyrs (Who has died in\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0043-356e2b3616e8:d01\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 650, \"text\": \"Dargazin County - Wikipedia Jump to content Main menu Main menu move to sidebar hide Navigation Main page Contents Current events Random article About Wikipedia Contact us Contribute Help Learn to edit Community portal Recent changes Upload file Special pages Search Search Appearance Donate Create account Log in Personal tools Donate Create account Log in Pages for logged out editors learn more Contributions Talk Contents move to sidebar hide ( Top ) 1 History 2 Demographics Toggle Demographics subsection 2.1 Administrative divisions 3 See also 4 Notes 5 References Toggle the table of contents Dargazin County 10 languages العربية Azərbaycanca\"}, \"D3S1\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0043-356e2b3616e8:d02\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 190, \"text\": \"the Qorveh , Gorveh , Kordestan Air Quality Widget on your Windows Desktop , just download the `` Qorveh , Gorveh , Kordestan .gadget '' and let you be guided through the Windows installer .\"}, \"D3S2\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0043-356e2b3616e8:d02\", \"start\": 191, \"end\": 243, \"text\": \"Download `` Qorveh , Gorveh , Kordestan .gadget '' .\"}, \"D3S3\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0043-356e2b3616e8:d02\", \"start\": 244, \"end\": 371, \"text\": \"You can download the Qorveh , Gorveh , Kordestan Air Quality Widget on your Android Device directly from the google app store .\"}, \"D3S4\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0043-356e2b3616e8:d02\", \"start\": 372, \"end\": 423, \"text\": \"( ä½ å¯ä » ¥ä »  Googleååº ä¸è½½æ­¤åºç¨ ) .\"}, \"D3S5\": {\"document_number\": 3, \"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0043-356e2b3616e8:d02\", \"start\": 424, \"end\": 528, \"text\": \"In case the Android app store can not be accessed , you can also directly download the signed apk file .\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0043-356e2b3616e8:d00\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0043-356e2b3616e8:d00:c0\", \"entity\": \"Qerveh\", \"scope\": \"2006 census\", \"claim\": \"At the 2006 census, the population of Qerveh was 2,772.\", \"answer\": \"2,772\", \"quote\": \"Qerveh, Zanjan Qerveh (, also Romanized as Qorveh; also known as Farvah, Ghorveh, Quenveh, and Qurveh) is a village in Howmeh Rural District, in the Central District of Abhar County, Zanjan Province, Iran. At the 2006 census, its population was 2,772, in 720 families.\", \"original_document_number\": 1}], \"R5_answers\": [\"2,772\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"an